    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math practical but not deeply intuitive. As a vocational diploma holder with a focus on economics and history, I use basic math daily but avoid complex theory. I’m comfortable with applied math but prefer real-world connections over abstract concepts.",
